      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "a2b3b9fa-f013-4af1-a46b-512092fc0e8c",
      "markdown": "# Astroshop primary Grail tags\nReviews the primary tags and fields set for the OpenTelemetry Demo (`otel-demo` namespace):\n* namespace annotations: `primary_tags.app`, `dt.security_context`, `dt.cost.costcenter`, `dt.cost.product`\n* per-workload `metadata.dynatrace.com/*` labels: `primary_tags.business_service`, `primary_tags.business_service_name`, `primary_tags.business_criticality`\n* collector `resource/dynatrace` processor: `primary_tags.monitoring_source` (traces, metrics, and logs sent to Dynatrace)\n\nSource: section 13 of ASTROSHOP-EKS.md.\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "bb9a34b4-c206-4dbb-8881-72bb5f9db71d",
      "markdown": "## Spans\n"
    },
