      "id": "30cae812-942e-4f5d-8c03-849607adb445",
      "markdown": "## Problems\nDavis problems carry the primary tags of their affected entities as arrays, so the filters use `in()` and the summaries use `expand`.\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dql",
      "id": "6c0f5203-c5d4-40d4-b350-959447755ac3",
      "title": "Astroshop problems with their primary tags",
